ly 1776 -&lt;BR/&gt;29 Sep 2008&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Now it&#39;s just another Third World failed state, run by a kleptocratic criminal mafia.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7010630768189355318/comments/default/3990841294383374702'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7010630768189355318/comments/default/3990841294383374702'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/09/rubicon-in-rear-view-part-i.html?showComment=1222620780000#c3990841294383374702' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/09/rubicon-in-rear-view-part-i.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7010630768189355318' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7010630768189355318' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 28, 2008 at 10:53 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5931555752556738777</id><published>2008-09-28T10:23:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-09-28T10:23:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>When we once again learn that bureaucrats and gov&#39;...</title><content type='html'>When we once again learn that bureaucrats and gov&#39;t employees are nothing more than tax trough parasites we will have the proper perspective.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The only good bureaucrat/gov&#39;t employee is one who is stretching a rope . . .&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Sic Semper Tyrannis</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7010630768189355318