ect our share of the &quot;investment&quot; being made in a collapsing housing market.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7010630768189355318/comments/default/4724535472465644235'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7010630768189355318/comments/default/4724535472465644235'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/09/rubicon-in-rear-view-part-i.html?showComment=1222389480000#c4724535472465644235' title=''/><author><name>Puck T. Smith</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11165510652453834268</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_qK9i58NDD9k/SMMXKpwORyI/AAAAAAAAAAM/PRS-bXotPmk/S220/mini_me_avatar.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/09/rubicon-in-rear-view-part-i.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7010630768189355318' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7010630768189355318' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-196159450"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 25, 2008 at 6:38 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3616627084387126606</id><published>2008-09-25T17:52:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-09-25T17:52:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Yes, in the next installment I hope you will give ...</title><content type='html'>Yes, in the next installment I hope you will give your opinion on who is behind it. Profit can&#39;t be the only motive. It&#39;s too Orwellian, given the language officialdom uses. This is a highly organized system of creeping tyranny, all the more perverse in light of the fact that it is now obvious criminal forces in control of government